  "notes": [
    "Mandarin says older or younger: 哥哥 is an older brother, 妹妹 a younger sister.",
    "个 (gè) is a measure word. Chinese puts one between a number and a noun: 一个妹妹, 三个孩子.",
    "Two before a measure word is 两 (liǎng), not 二: 两个哥哥.",
    "有 (have) is made negative with 没, not 不: 没有孩子."
  ]
